{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1601672,\"title\":\"My Name Is The Sound I Use To Introduce Myself\",\"tagline\":\"A group of young men waltz in pairs as an allegory of growing up.\",\"overview\":\"A group of young men waltz in pairs, balancing with a glass between their foreheads. In this captivating setting, director Albert Rask crafts a new code of conduct - an allegory reflecting the experience of growing up. A playful yet poignant exploration that reframes the burdens of responsibility, expectations and the rules of adulthood.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rCfKu1JH9PF1lhbxoNtylZxNeQW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cPuN0XG1jIRu2wK5sXYWmrv9kX0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2024,\"runtime\":9,\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"NL\",\"name\":\"Netherlands\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Albert Rask\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":5890000,\"name\":\"Albert Rask\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":259872,\"title\":\"Skin. Like. Sun.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uCkANtG6ezb7hjRKVudY3PUcbvn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dzY2ZYyPRbXcw8UOupHK3V5VQYk.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Real-life young couple Wim and Floor spend an afternoon in the sunwashed rooms of a crumbling home in Belgium. In a unique twist, this artistic erotic documentary is edited in nearly real-time. In the slowness, we get the build, the sweetness, and the sexiness. Forget about fingersnapping fast editing. Slow is where it’s at.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1666428,\"title\":\"MIGAJERO!!\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fot4D3fAYA21CafbCIvwGuIVZKX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7o70XRYBPOhrzl0hI3kd3Ioxgft.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This is an intimate and fragmented portrait of what it means to fall in love in the 21st century. Where desire, breadcrumbing, and vulnerability intertwine in a process of falling, self-creation, and pure frenzy.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":665913,\"title\":\"Legendary\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ueowwmclDnprqOuSFwYg3IAYvLh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An inside look into the effort to preserve Philadelphia's ballroom scene, a black LGBTQ safe-space that has endured for 30 years.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1259267,\"title\":\"The Chewing\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AeVzmi8PWD31375yXlPXrNfb7WX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":8,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Dylan, a girl who can't stand the sound of chewing navigates a world of messy eaters until she is pushed over the edge.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Romance\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1061671,\"title\":\"Pamela, a love story\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zkVnRwZWbrd55P3Tx7BZZQ1gU89.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aJvgoRMrYFTMu7MrcfxYVPMRuU5.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In her own words, through personal video and diaries, Pamela Anderson shares the story of her rise to fame, rocky romances and infamous sex tape scandal.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":663130,\"title\":\"Step for You\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ibbPGC4qowaxn3qMWAMse7vktPg.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pKpIScRVgIqW9W6E3xodRrZZBAR.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Yu Sang starts to learn to dance for the interview, but he can't hide his feelings from Jun Han.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":27943,\"title\":\"Dance of the Dragon\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hNyKo4LPDsEFE3jx1tGl4hO9Wqv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eBAbLYmDyOz3NmP0KDKdXBbqF11.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of three people whose lives are pulled into review and assessment when their paths cross. The initial sparks of what could be a new romance plays off against a couple falling out of love, a student and teacher, a father and son, a mother's influence and competing suitors - all explored with sensitivity, delicacy and refined artistry.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":288210,\"title\":\"Burlesque Undressed\",\"poster\":null,\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":6,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In this revealing documentary, burlesque star Immodesty Blaize examines the world of British burlesque and the resurgence in its popularity.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":681592,\"title\":\"The World of Vija Vētra\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7tLjUVxTEcAJ3XRIu97T4Tr5DRI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vr2tYvxUW30nh09cnOnVi5JiwSv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"This documentary tells the fascinating story of Vija Vetra, a world-renowned Latvian dancer, choreographer and teacher. At the age of 84, Vetra remains a vital and creative force, and her tale offers inspiration for both artists and lovers of the arts. In a career spanning seven decades, she has mastered diverse styles ranging from ballet to traditional Indian dance, and her talent has won her acclaim as a 'spirit in human form' and 'the bridge between East and West.' Her life is a celebration of the power and beauty of the art of dance, but is also a powerful story of struggle, loneliness and sacrifice. Her creative , positive spirit stands alone against a materialistic world that is constantly changing. Her wise soul, her point of view and criticism towards the modern world push us to think about secret meanings, symbols and the simplicity of life.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":681532,\"title\":\"Wallflower\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ygGQMfwiTE7wb1D4YyDHahiJBJ5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An overdressed girl tries her luck in dance events that are for Finnish tourists in a small Estonian health resort town, Pärnu.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1454791,\"title\":\"Something to Call Our Own\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ryBhaBYXPEZLnBQyfM7caNqwbW0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\\\"Something to Call Our Own\\\" is a compelling documentary that delves into the origins, obstacles, and evolution of modern CHamoru dance. From the small island of Guam to the international stage of FestPAC, the documentary showcases the inspiring story of cultural revival, resilience, and the ongoing journey to reclaim and preserve a tradition that belongs to the CHamoru people.  Once silenced by colonization, the CHamoru people rise—through song, chant, and dance. At the heart of this revival stands Master Frank Rabon, who dared to reimagine a lost tradition, giving it back to the generations who longed for it. From the shores of Guam to the world stage of FestPAC the CHamoru people reclaim their identity, their language, their pride. Through every movement, there’s a dance and with every dance they declare: We are still here and this is Something to Call Our Own.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"gLacqBs4V1U\",\"name\":\"My name is the sound I use to introduce myself (trailer)\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}